-- Baseline migration: marks the current schema state as the starting point for migrate.
-- This project previously used `prisma db push` with no migrations directory.
-- The tables already exist in production; this file is a no-op for existing databases
-- and is here only so that `prisma migrate deploy` and `prisma migrate diff` have a baseline.
--
-- To apply to a fresh database, run `prisma migrate deploy` which executes this file first,
-- then the incremental migrations that follow.
--
-- DO NOT edit this file. It is a snapshot, not a runnable create-from-scratch script.
-- The definitive schema is always prisma/schema.prisma.

-- Intentionally empty: baseline marker only.
-- The real schema is maintained in prisma/schema.prisma.
